  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      307.61,
      401.87,
      331.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Nation Building Tax(Amendment) Act, No. of 2020.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      346.61,
      401.89,
      422.99
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 3 of the Nation Building Tax Act, No. 9 of2009 as last amended by Act, No. 20 of 2019, is herebyfurther amended in subsection (1) by the substitution for thewords, \u201cbe charged from every person\u201d, of the words andfigures \u201cbe charged prior to December 1, 2019, from everyperson\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      433.73,
      401.88,
      456.71
    ],
    "text": "3. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
